<h1>Edit Mode for Labels</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-US">The</span> <span class="Command">Edit mode</span> <span lang="EN-US">command is accessible from</span> <b><i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Labels &gt; Edit Mode</b></span></i></b> <span lang="EN-US">in</span> <span class="Mode" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Inspection</u></span> <span lang="EN-US">mode or by pressing</span> <b><i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Button" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Edit labels mode</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">button</span></i> in the</b> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Inspection</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">toolbar.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">This command switches the mode for creating and editing labels in Inspection. In this mode a <u><a href="../User_Interface/Label_Context_Menu.htm">context menu</a></u> appears when pointing on a label with the RMB, offering all functions associated to the label editing.</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Create</b></span></b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>label</b></span><span lang="EN-US">: The cursor changes to label tool <img src="../Images/image053.gif" width="37px" height="34px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt="">. Click on a point, in which you're interested to create a label. If the</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Auto Arrange</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">option is on, the labels are positioned on the edge of the viewport and when you rotate or translate the entities, they are repositioned automatically. If the</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Auto Arrange</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">option is off, the labels are positioned close to the point of interest. On the picture below there is a label, where all available information is shown and a scheme explaining the values displayed.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial; text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-US"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Label schematic</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP162054499" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<table class="Normal" style="width:46.3%; margin-left:72.0pt; border-spacing:0px;" cellspacing="0" width="46.3%">
<tr>
<td valign="top" width="29.6%" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;"><img src="../Images/image054.gif" width="194px" height="153px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></font></span></p>
</td>
<td valign="top" width="70.38%" class="whs7">
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;"><img src="../Images/image055.gif" width="254px" height="187px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></font></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" valign="top" width="29.6%" class="whs5">
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">X - X position of the point in world co-ordinate system</font></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">Y - Y position of the point in world co-ordinate system</font></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">Z - Z position of the point in world co-ordinate system</font></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">Dx</font></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">- error on X-axis</font></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">Dy</font></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">- error on Y-axis</font></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">Dz</font></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">- error on Z-axis</font></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">D - error vector length</font></span></p>
<p id="p1"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">Note</font></span></b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial;"><font size="2" style="font-size:10pt;">: The options Dx, Dy, Dz are enabled only when inspecting surfaces. Otherwise they will have value n.a. (Not available).</font></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Modify</b></span></b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>label</b></span><span lang="EN-US">: When you pass over an existing label the cursor changes its shape to <img src="../Images/image056.gif" width="22px" height="26px" border="0" class="img_whs9" alt=""></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-US">To modify label's position, just click on it and drag the label to the position you want.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial; text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-US"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Move label example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP222702255" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><span lang="EN-US"><img src="../Images/image057.gif" width="310px" height="205px" border="0" class="img_whs10" alt=""></span></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Delete</b></span></b><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>label</b></span><span lang="EN-US">: When the user clicks over an existing label using the right mouse button the context menu will appear. As mentioned above it offers all functions associated to the label editing, i.e. all commands from the label menu and one additional for deleting the pointed label.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-US"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a3" style="text-decoration:underline;">Delete label example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP288492167" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><span lang="EN-US"><img src="../Images/image058.gif" width="198px" height="241px" border="0" class="img_whs11" alt=""></span></p>
</div>
